al number of units in a window of 3 preceding and 1 following row ordered by the course number, the school name, and the department phone number. Also, include the reason for inclusion ('TopSubjects' for top 10 by materials, 'Subjects2014FA' for 2014FA subjects with enrollment). The columns should be: subject title, department name, material count, offering department name, responsible faculty name, TIP material status key, total units, window column, school name, department phone, and reason. Do not return any rounded answers."
